Build a **Kanban Task Management Board**! 🚀  

### Features:  
✅ Drag and drop tasks between columns (To Do, In Progress, Done).  
✅ Local storage to save tasks persistently.  
✅ Editable task titles and descriptions.  
✅ Add and delete tasks dynamically.  
✅ Smooth animations for a polished UI.  

This will boost your JavaScript skills with DOM manipulation, event handling, local storage, and even touch-based interactions for mobile! 💪